    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend The Cubes at all costs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DTC (Defend The Cubes) is a unique tower defense game where you deploy units to stop enemies before they destroy the cube. Unlike traditional tower defense games, DTC focuses on strategic unit placement rather than static towers. Plan your defense, adapt to enemy waves, and protect the cube from destruction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Unit Deployment</strong> \u2013 Place and control units to counter enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pathing</strong> \u2013 Enemies follow unique paths around the cube, keeping the action unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Yet Engaging Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend The Cubes at all costs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DTC (Defend The Cubes) is a unique tower defense game where you deploy units to stop enemies before they destroy the cube. Unlike traditional tower defense games, DTC focuses on strategic unit placement rather than static towers. Plan your defense, adapt to enemy waves, and protect the cube from destruction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Unit Deployment</strong> \u2013 Place and control units to counter enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pathing</strong> \u2013 Enemies follow unique paths around the cube, keeping the action unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Yet Engaging Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "DTC (Defend The Cubes) is a tower defense game where you deploy units to stop enemies before they destroy the cube. Strategize, fight off waves, and keep the cube safe!",
